    "difficulty": 5,
    "marks": 7,
    "estimatedSeconds": 480,
    "stem": "(Cambridge Extended) The total energy $E$ joules of a moving object of mass $m$ kg at height $h$ m with speed $v$ m/s is $E = mgh + \\frac{1}{2}mv^2$, where $g$ is a constant.",
    "parts": [
